t').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#same_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:form {:class "form-inline form-inline-header"} [:select {:name "id", :id "other_games_select", :class "form-control"} [:option {:value ""} "In other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "18000039"} "2020"]] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/2544"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "3x3 Basketball, Women" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "30 July –  5 August 2024"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/2168"} "Place de la Concorde, Paris, France"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/2002129"} "32 from 8 countries"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Format"] [:td {:colspan "2"} "Robin robin tournament, followed by single elimination."]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "The United States women were the defending gold medalists and were the only nation to win the World Cup multiple times, winning in 2012, 2014, and 2023. Host nation France had won the 2022 World Cup, was runner-up to the USA in 2023, and had the most World Cup podium finishes of any nation, with five."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Germany led the round-robin phase, winning six of seven games to advance straight to the semi-finals, along with Spain. The United States survived a terrible start, losing its first three games, but then won its final four games to make the quarter-finals. France, among the favorites, finished last in the round-robin and did not advance."] "\n\n" [:p {} "In the quarter-finals, Canada and the United States easily defeated Australia and China, respectively. The semis matched Germany against Canada and Spain against the USA, and both matches were close, Germany advancing 16-15, and Spain moving on, 18-16."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The final rounds were also close, as Germany won the gold medal by defeating Spain 17-16, and the United States took bronze over Canada, 16-13. Germany’s gold medal was considered an upset as they had never won a medal previously at the FIBA World Cup in 3x3 basketball or full-court basketball."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button394175", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button394175').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Games Played", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "GP"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Won"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Lost"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Points / Game", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "PPG"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Time Played / Game", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "TPG"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Plus / Minus", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "+/-"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Shooting Efficiency", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "SE"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "1-Point Field Goals", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "1P"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "1-Point Field Goals %", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "1P%"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "2-Point Field Goals", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "2P"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "2-Point Field Goals %", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "2P%"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Free